FlashDB-rs
Copyright (c) 2026 littepoint

This project is an independent Rust implementation of the on-flash format and
behaviour of FlashDB:

    FlashDB - https://github.com/armink/FlashDB
    Copyright (c) 2020 Armink <armink.ztl@gmail.com>
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

FlashDB itself is not included in this repository. The C sources are fetched by
scripts/fetch_reference.sh and compiled unmodified to provide the differential
reference used by the tests and benchmarks (byte-identical flash images,
behavioural parity, ROM/RAM measurements).
